cf55/file-1l1avxcww.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l1avxcwv/73f21066-7e70-4630-9a4c-6106735c1376/8682e2f0-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1avxcww.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l1avxcwv/73f21066-7e70-4630-9a4c-6106735c1376/8682e2f0-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1avxcww.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l1avxcwv/73f21066-7e70-4630-9a4c-6106735c1376/8682e2f0-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1avxcww.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l1avxcwv/73f21066-7e70-4630-9a4c-6106735c1376/8682e2f0-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1avxcww.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l1avxcwv/73f21066-7e70-4630-9a4c-6106735c1376/8682e2f0-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1avxcww.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"Regioselectivity means which group will react selectively in the presence of two or more than two functional groups. Here, among two functional group <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>NH<sub>2</sub> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>CONH<sub>2</sub>, NH<sub>2</sub> is more nucleophilic hence, NH<sub>2</sub> group will undergo reaction faster than CONH<sub>2</sub>.<br><br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 29 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l1aw1h0l/d1c53519-b2bc-418f-bf1c-0fcd70cce455/f8eae950-aeae-11ec-b33f-bb21af84cf55/file-1l1aw1h0m.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"><br>Hence, correct choice is (a)."}]}